# What the agent VM needs inside the kernel (there are no modules): the root disk, ext4, the
# virtio devices QEMU gives it (network, serial port, entropy) and the container-ish features the
# guest tools use. Appended to Alpine's config with modules switched off.
CONFIG_VIRTIO_BLK=y
CONFIG_VIRTIO_NET=y
CONFIG_VIRTIO_CONSOLE=y
CONFIG_HW_RANDOM=y
CONFIG_HW_RANDOM_VIRTIO=y
CONFIG_EXT4_FS=y
CONFIG_CRC32C=y
CONFIG_CRYPTO_CRC32C=y
CONFIG_KERNEL_LZ4=y
# CONFIG_KERNEL_GZIP is not set
